{
  "id": "c07",
  "title": {
    "zh-CN": "探索·情趣玩具"
  },
  "start": "c07_n0001",
  "nodes": {
    "c07_n0001": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "暑假第九天的傍晚，特蕾西抱着个快递盒进了房间，反手锁上门。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c07",
        "nodeId": "c07_n0002"
      }
    },
    "c07_n0002": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "盒子不大，轻。她拆得却慢，手指有点抖。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c07",
        "nodeId": "c07_n0003"
      }
    },
    "c07_n0003": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "里面是个粉紫色的东西，小小的，胶囊形状，一头圆，光滑得反光。旁边还压着张折成小块的说明书。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c07",
        "nodeId": "c07_n0004"
      }
    },
    "c07_n0004": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "特蕾西把那东西捏在手里翻来覆去看了两圈，又摊开说明书。字没看进去几行，脸先烧起来。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c07",
        "nodeId": "c07_n0005"
      }
    },
    "c07_n0005": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "她买这个，是在逛网购的时候手滑点的。付完款才意识到自己干了什么，想退，又鬼使神差地没退。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c07",
        "nodeId": "c07_n0006"
      }
    },
    "c07_n0006": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "她把说明书从头到尾看了一遍，越看耳朵越红，最后"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c07",
        "nodeId": "c07_n0007"
      }
    },
    "c07_n0007": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "啪"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c07",
        "nodeId": "c07_n0008"
      }
    },
    "c07_n0008": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "地合上，连东西带盒子一起塞进了床头柜最下面一层，压了本书在上面。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c07",
        "nodeId": "c07_n0009"
      }
    },
    "c07_n0009": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "机械师做事，向来是先拆解，再研究。可这个，她拆开了，反而不敢研究了。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c07",
        "nodeId": "c07_n0010"
      }
    },
    "c07_n0010": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "她盯着床头柜，脑子里忽然冒出一个念头——要是让卢卡知道了，他会不会一脸正经地凑过来，问她"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c07",
        "nodeId": "c07_n0011"
      }
    },
    "c07_n0011": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "这个怎么用"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c07",
        "nodeId": "c07_n0012"
      }
    },
    "c07_n0012": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c07",
        "nodeId": "c07_n0013"
      }
    },
    "c07_n0013": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "光是想想，她就又想笑，又想钻地缝。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c07",
        "nodeId": "c07_n0014"
      }
    },
    "c07_n0014": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "晚上，卢卡来了。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c07",
        "nodeId": "c07_n0015"
      }
    },
    "c07_n0015": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "说好一起打游戏，结果两局没打完，特蕾西就心不在焉地死了三次。卢卡放下手柄，侧头看她。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c07",
        "nodeId": "c07_n0016"
      }
    },
    "c07_n0016": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "你怎么了。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c07",
        "nodeId": "c07_n0017"
      },
      "speaker": "luca"
    },
    "c07_n0017": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "……没。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c07",
        "nodeId": "c07_n0018"
      },
      "speaker": "tracy"
    },
    "c07_n0018": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "特蕾西盯着屏幕，不看他，"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c07",
        "nodeId": "c07_n0019"
      }
    },
    "c07_n0019": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "就是有个东西，想给你看。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c07",
        "nodeId": "c07_n0020"
      },
      "speaker": "tracy"
    },
    "c07_n0020": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "什么。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c07",
        "nodeId": "c07_n0021"
      },
      "speaker": "luca"
    },
    "c07_n0021": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "她没动。过了好一会儿，才慢吞吞地站起来，走到床头柜前，蹲下去，把最下面一层抽屉拉开。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c07",
        "nodeId": "c07_n0022"
      }
    },
    "c07_n0022": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "她背对着卢卡，把那个粉紫色的小东西攥在手里，转过身。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c07",
        "nodeId": "c07_n0023"
      }
    },
    "c07_n0023": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "这个。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c07",
        "nodeId": "c07_n0024"
      },
      "speaker": "tracy"
    },
    "c07_n0024": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "她别开脸，声音小得几乎听不见，"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c07",
        "nodeId": "c07_n0025"
      }
    },
    "c07_n0025": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "我买的。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c07",
        "nodeId": "c07_n0026"
      },
      "speaker": "tracy"
    },
    "c07_n0026": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "卢卡凑过来看。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c07",
        "nodeId": "c07_n0027"
      }
    },
    "c07_n0027": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "这是什么。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c07",
        "nodeId": "c07_n0028"
      },
      "speaker": "luca"
    },
    "c07_n0028": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "他说，顿了一下，又自己反应过来，耳根也红了，"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c07",
        "nodeId": "c07_n0029"
      }
    },
    "c07_n0029": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "……哦。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c07",
        "nodeId": "c07_n0030"
      },
      "speaker": "tracy"
    },
    "c07_n0030": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "你'哦'什么。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c07",
        "nodeId": "c07_n0031"
      },
      "speaker": "tracy"
    },
    "c07_n0031": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "特蕾西更窘了，"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c07",
        "nodeId": "c07_n0032"
      }
    },
    "c07_n0032": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "你倒是说点别的。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c07",
        "nodeId": "c07_n0033"
      },
      "speaker": "luca"
    },
    "c07_n0033": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "……怎么用。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c07",
        "nodeId": "c07_n0034"
      },
      "speaker": "tracy"
    },
    "c07_n0034": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "特蕾西差点把东西砸他脸上。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c07",
        "nodeId": "c07_n0035"
      }
    },
    "c07_n0035": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "我研究过说明书了。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c07",
        "nodeId": "c07_n0036"
      },
      "speaker": "luca"
    },
    "c07_n0036": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "她硬撑着，把东西塞进他手里，"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c07",
        "nodeId": "c07_n0037"
      }
    },
    "c07_n0037": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "震动的。按这里。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c07",
        "nodeId": "c07_n0038"
      },
      "speaker": "tracy"
    },
    "c07_n0038": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "她伸手去够他掌心里那个小东西，指尖按了一下圆头下面的小凸起。那东西"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c07",
        "nodeId": "c07_n0039"
      }
    },
    "c07_n0039": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "嗡"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c07",
        "nodeId": "c07_n0040"
      },
      "speaker": "luca"
    },
    "c07_n0040": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "地一震，震得两个人都是一激灵。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c07",
        "nodeId": "c07_n0041"
      }
    },
    "c07_n0041": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "嗡嗡嗡……"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c07",
        "nodeId": "c07_n0042"
      }
    },
    "c07_n0042": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "……关了。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c07",
        "nodeId": "c07_n0043"
      },
      "speaker": "tracy"
    },
    "c07_n0043": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "特蕾西慌忙去按，越急越按不对，东西在卢卡手里震个没完。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c07",
        "nodeId": "c07_n0044"
      }
    },
    "c07_n0044": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "卢卡笑出声，自己找到开关，按灭。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c07",
        "nodeId": "c07_n0045"
      }
    },
    "c07_n0045": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "你慌什么。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c07",
        "nodeId": "c07_n0046"
      },
      "speaker": "luca"
    },
    "c07_n0046": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "他说，"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c07",
        "nodeId": "c07_n0047"
      }
    },
    "c07_n0047": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "又不咬人。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c07",
        "nodeId": "c07_n0048"
      },
      "speaker": "luca"
    },
    "c07_n0048": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "特蕾西狠狠瞪他一眼，耳尖却红得要滴血。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c07",
        "nodeId": "c07_n0049"
      }
    },
    "c07_n0049": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "那……"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c07",
        "nodeId": "c07_n0050"
      },
      "speaker": "tracy"
    },
    "c07_n0050": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "她咬咬牙，"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c07",
        "nodeId": "c07_n0051"
      }
    },
    "c07_n0051": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "试不试。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c07",
        "nodeId": "c07_n0052"
      },
      "speaker": "luca"
    },
    "c07_n0052": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "卢卡看着她，喉结滚了一下。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c07",
        "nodeId": "c07_n0053"
      }
    },
    "c07_n0053": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "你确定？"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c07",
        "nodeId": "c07_n0054"
      },
      "speaker": "tracy"
    },
    "c07_n0054": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "买都买了。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c07",
        "nodeId": "c07_n0055"
      },
      "speaker": "tracy"
    },
    "c07_n0055": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "特蕾西说，眼睛不敢看他，"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c07",
        "nodeId": "c07_n0056"
      }
    },
    "c07_n0056": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "不试，浪费。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c07",
        "nodeId": "c07_n0057"
      },
      "speaker": "tracy"
    },
    "c07_n0057": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "她坐回床上，靠进靠垫里，把睡裙往上撩，撩到腿根。内裤还在，是那条黑蕾丝。她并着腿，又慢慢打开。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c07",
        "nodeId": "c07_n0058"
      }
    },
    "c07_n0058": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "你……来。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c07",
        "nodeId": "c07_n0059"
      },
      "speaker": "luca"
    },
    "c07_n0059": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "她声音发颤，"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c07",
        "nodeId": "c07_n0060"
      }
    },
    "c07_n0060": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "我教你。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c07",
        "nodeId": "c07_n0061"
      },
      "speaker": "tracy"
    },
    "c07_n0061": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "卢卡坐过来，手里还捏着那个小东西。特蕾西抓着他的手腕，把玩具往自己腿间带。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c07",
        "nodeId": "c07_n0062"
      }
    },
    "c07_n0062": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "先……别进去。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c07",
        "nodeId": "c07_n0063"
      },
      "speaker": "luca"
    },
    "c07_n0063": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "她喘着，"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c07",
        "nodeId": "c07_n0064"
      }
    },
    "c07_n0064": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "就放在外面。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c07",
        "nodeId": "c07_n0065"
      },
      "speaker": "tracy"
    },
    "c07_n0065": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "他把圆头贴上去，隔着内裤。特蕾西"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c07",
        "nodeId": "c07_n0066"
      }
    },
    "c07_n0066": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "嗯"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c07",
        "nodeId": "c07_n0067"
      },
      "speaker": "luca"
    },
    "c07_n0067": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "了一声，腿抖了一下。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c07",
        "nodeId": "c07_n0068"
      }
    },
    "c07_n0068": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "开。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c07",
        "nodeId": "c07_n0069"
      },
      "speaker": "tracy"
    },
    "c07_n0069": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "她说。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c07",
        "nodeId": "c07_n0070"
      }
    },
    "c07_n0070": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "卢卡按下开关。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c07",
        "nodeId": "c07_n0071"
      }
    },
    "c07_n0071": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "嗡嗡嗡……"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c07",
        "nodeId": "c07_n0072"
      }
    },
    "c07_n0072": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "嗯……哈……♡"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c07",
        "nodeId": "c07_n0073"
      },
      "speaker": "luca"
    },
    "c07_n0073": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "特蕾西整个人软下去一点，头往后仰，短金发铺在靠垫上。那点震动隔着薄薄一层蕾丝传进来，酥麻从小腹一路往上爬。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c07",
        "nodeId": "c07_n0074"
      }
    },
    "c07_n0074": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "……好麻。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c07",
        "nodeId": "c07_n0075"
      },
      "speaker": "tracy"
    },
    "c07_n0075": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "她喘着，眼睛半闭，"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c07",
        "nodeId": "c07_n0076"
      }
    },
    "c07_n0076": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "卢卡，你……按实一点。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c07",
        "nodeId": "c07_n0077"
      },
      "speaker": "luca"
    },
    "c07_n0077": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "卢卡把手压下去，圆头贴着她的内裤，震得更深。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c07",
        "nodeId": "c07_n0078"
      }
    },
    "c07_n0078": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "啊……就、就是这样……♡"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c07",
        "nodeId": "c07_n0079"
      },
      "speaker": "tracy"
    },
    "c07_n0079": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "她伸手，把内裤往旁边拨开，露出湿漉漉的小穴。那里已经湿透了，小穴微微张合，泛着水光。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c07",
        "nodeId": "c07_n0080"
      }
    },
    "c07_n0080": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "贴上来……"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c07",
        "nodeId": "c07_n0081"
      },
      "speaker": "tracy"
    },
    "c07_n0081": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "她说，"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c07",
        "nodeId": "c07_n0082"
      }
    },
    "c07_n0082": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "直接贴。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c07",
        "nodeId": "c07_n0083"
      },
      "speaker": "tracy"
    },
    "c07_n0083": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "卢卡把玩具贴在她光裸的穴口。特蕾西"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c07",
        "nodeId": "c07_n0084"
      }
    },
    "c07_n0084": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "咿"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c07",
        "nodeId": "c07_n0085"
      },
      "speaker": "luca"
    },
    "c07_n0085": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "了一声，两条腿猛地一夹，又强迫自己打开。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c07",
        "nodeId": "c07_n0086"
      }
    },
    "c07_n0086": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "嗡嗡嗡……咕啾……"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c07",
        "nodeId": "c07_n0087"
      }
    },
    "c07_n0087": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "哈啊……好奇怪……又好舒服……♡"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c07",
        "nodeId": "c07_n0088"
      },
      "speaker": "tracy"
    },
    "c07_n0088": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "她仰着头，胸随着呼吸起伏，乳肉在睡裙下软软地颤。她自己伸手，把睡裙整个撩到胸口以上，露出那对乳。乳尖挺着，是淡淡的粉。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c07",
        "nodeId": "c07_n0089"
      }
    },
    "c07_n0089": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "卢卡……"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c07",
        "nodeId": "c07_n0090"
      },
      "speaker": "luca"
    },
    "c07_n0090": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "她喘着，"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c07",
        "nodeId": "c07_n0091"
      }
    },
    "c07_n0091": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "你……另一边，摸摸。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c07",
        "nodeId": "c07_n0092"
      },
      "speaker": "tracy"
    },
    "c07_n0092": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "卢卡空着的那只手覆上她的胸，揉。乳肉在他掌心里陷下去，又弹回来。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c07",
        "nodeId": "c07_n0093"
      }
    },
    "c07_n0093": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "嗯……卢卡……♡"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c07",
        "nodeId": "c07_n0094"
      },
      "speaker": "luca"
    },
    "c07_n0094": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "特蕾西的腰小幅度地摆，两条腿越张越开，脚跟蹬着床单。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c07",
        "nodeId": "c07_n0095"
      }
    },
    "c07_n0095": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "里面……"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c07",
        "nodeId": "c07_n0096"
      },
      "speaker": "tracy"
    },
    "c07_n0096": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "她忽然抓住他的手，"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c07",
        "nodeId": "c07_n0097"
      }
    },
    "c07_n0097": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "放进去一点点……"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c07",
        "nodeId": "c07_n0098"
      },
      "speaker": "luca"
    },
    "c07_n0098": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "卢卡把圆头顺着湿滑的穴口往里送了一点。特蕾西整个人绷了一下，又松开，小穴紧紧含着那个小东西。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c07",
        "nodeId": "c07_n0099"
      }
    },
    "c07_n0099": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "嗡嗡嗡……咕啾……咕啾……"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c07",
        "nodeId": "c07_n0100"
      }
    },
    "c07_n0100": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "咿……卢卡……好麻……里面好麻……♡"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c07",
        "nodeId": "c07_n0101"
      },
      "speaker": "tracy"
    },
    "c07_n0101": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "舒服吗？"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c07",
        "nodeId": "c07_n0102"
      },
      "speaker": "luca"
    },
    "c07_n0102": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "卢卡低低地问。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c07",
        "nodeId": "c07_n0103"
      }
    },
    "c07_n0103": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "舒服……"
