      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "她说，"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c07",
        "nodeId": "c07_n0126"
      }
    },
    "c07_n0126": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "别停……"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c07",
        "nodeId": "c07_n0127"
      },
      "speaker": "tracy"
    },
    "c07_n0127": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "卢卡一边顶，一边揉她的胸，另一只手还按着那枚玩具。特蕾西仰着头，眼睛半闭，嘴里的声音碎成一片。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c07",
        "nodeId": "c07_n0128"
      }
    },
    "c07_n0128": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "啊……卢卡……再快……再快一点……♡"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c07",
        "nodeId": "c07_n0129"
      },
      "speaker": "luca"
    },
    "c07_n0129": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "他加快了。肉棒在她湿滑的穴里进出，带出黏黏的水，混着玩具的震动声。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c07",
        "nodeId": "c07_n0130"
      }
    },
    "c07_n0130": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "嗡嗡……咕啾……啪……啪……"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c07",
        "nodeId": "c07_n0131"
      }
    },
    "c07_n0131": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "要……"
