      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "她绷紧了，小穴一下下收缩，绞着他，腿夹得他动弹不得。过了几秒，才一点点软下来，瘫在床单里，胸口起伏着。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c07",
        "nodeId": "c07_n0136"
      }
    },
    "c07_n0136": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "卢卡把玩具按灭，扔到一边。他撑在她身上，喘得越来越重，动作也越来越重。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c07",
        "nodeId": "c07_n0137"
      }
    },
    "c07_n0137": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "特蕾西……"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c07",
        "nodeId": "c07_n0138"
      },
      "speaker": "luca"
    },
    "c07_n0138": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "他低低地喊，"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c07",
        "nodeId": "c07_n0139"
      }
    },
    "c07_n0139": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "我也要……"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c07",
        "nodeId": "c07_n0140"
      },
      "speaker": "luca"
    },
