      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "卢卡笑了一下，撑起一点，又没舍得退出去。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c07",
        "nodeId": "c07_n0151"
      }
    },
    "c07_n0151": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "那东西。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c07",
        "nodeId": "c07_n0152"
      },
      "speaker": "tracy"
    },
    "c07_n0152": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "特蕾西忽然说，眼睛看着天花板，"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c07",
        "nodeId": "c07_n0153"
      }
    },
    "c07_n0153": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "你说，还有没有别的。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c07",
        "nodeId": "c07_n0154"
      },
      "speaker": "tracy"
    },
    "c07_n0154": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "什么别的。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c07",
        "nodeId": "c07_n0155"
      },
      "speaker": "luca"
    },
    "c07_n0155": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "就是……"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c07",
        "nodeId": "c07_n0156"
      },
      "speaker": "tracy"
    },
    "c07_n0156": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "她别开脸，耳尖又红起来，"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c07",
        "nodeId": "c07_n0157"
      }
    },
    "c07_n0157": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "下次，我再买点别的试试。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c07",
        "nodeId": "c07_n0158"
      },
      "speaker": "luca"
    },
    "c07_n0158": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "卢卡低头看她，嘴角翘起来。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c07",
        "nodeId": "c07_n0159"
      }
    },
    "c07_n0159": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "随你。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c07",
        "nodeId": "c07_n0160"
      },
      "speaker": "luca"
    },
    "c07_n0160": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "他说，"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c07",
        "nodeId": "c07_n0161"
      }
    },
    "c07_n0161": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "我都配合。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c07",
        "nodeId": "c07_n0162"
      },
      "speaker": "luca"
    },
    "c07_n0162": {
      "kind": "line",
      "text": {
        "zh-CN": "特蕾西没接话，只把脸埋进他颈窝，把他抱得更紧了一点。床头柜的抽屉还开着，那枚粉紫色的小东西躺在床单边上，还带着点没散的热气。"
      },
      "next": {
        "chapterId": "c08",
        "nodeId": "c08_n0001"
      }
    }
  }
}
